  "description": {
   "en": "Legend of Crystania is set 300 years in the future from Lodoss, and is set on the continent of Crystania where the refugees from Marmo landed. It follows Pirotess's quest to free Ashram from the gripes of the animal god Barbas, and the hero Redon and his companions in a quest to free Crystania from Barbas' control.\n___\n**Buy:**\n- Volume 1: [Amazon](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4073039245), [Suruga-ya](https://www.suruga-ya.jp/product/detail/504016001)\n- Volume 2: [Amazon](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/407304303X), [Suruga-ya](https://www.suruga-ya.jp/product/detail/504016002)\n- Volume 3: [Amazon](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4073046160), [Suruga-ya](https://www.suruga-ya.jp/product/detail/504016003)\n- All: [Suruga-ya](https://www.suruga-ya.jp/product/detail/WN965)"
